{
    "word": "syzygy",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                "word": "syzygy",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "51f0f6e6-a7e9-4d0d-b020-b92cf67c33fa",
                        "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "syzygies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "69234ef5-6bd3-3099-82b1-0d3d07b0836a",
                        "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An alignment of three celestial bodies (for example, the Sun, Earth, and Moon) such that one body is directly between the other two, such as occurs at an eclipse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ec1c02d-780f-47f5-8251-d3b21497d91a",
                                "sense_id": "69234ef5-6bd3-3099-82b1-0d3d07b0836a",
                                "text": "The duration of an eclipse depends on the relative positions of the sun, moon, and earth in their syzygy."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f72863a5-4a86-3f5a-8a72-4a6151c6e550",
                        "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An archetypal pairing of contrasexual opposites, symbolizing the communication of the conscious and unconscious minds."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dca9f845-79b0-4829-9b94-3934f1fc8648",
                                "sense_id": "f72863a5-4a86-3f5a-8a72-4a6151c6e550",
                                "text": "In 1936 Jung defends his concept of animus and anima by reference to the idea of the syzygy, concluding from the evidence in many different mythologies of the divine couple, united by a sacred marriage, that this motif is as universal as the existence of men and women. He postulates that in the syzygy the archetypal union of the parents is expressed, the mother corresponding to the anima."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1d14dd6b-3d54-3b35-8f6b-3f17b5d511ec",
                        "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A relation between generators of a module."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7faca7d5-d697-408e-b8b6-208ff578ecd4",
                                "sense_id": "1d14dd6b-3d54-3b35-8f6b-3f17b5d511ec",
                                "text": "A finitely presented module is an A-module M given by a finite number of generators and relations. Therefore it is a module with a finite generator set having a finitely generated syzygy module."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "72d89d9c-34c9-36b1-804b-97911825f24e",
                        "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The fusion of some or all of the organs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f8ec2df-5d58-364d-acd4-555872013bc9",
                        "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The association of two protozoa end-to-end or laterally for the purpose of asexual exchange of genetic material."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "161e651e-4683-4477-9618-fa33658ec4a1",
                                "sense_id": "8f8ec2df-5d58-364d-acd4-555872013bc9",
                                "text": "When two or more arm-joints meet transversely by a rigid suture, and only the upper one is pinnule-bearing, those joints form a syzygy, whether their apposed faces are striated, dotted, or smooth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bf75504-f623-4b60-9af2-5a7fafade8e1",
                                "sense_id": "8f8ec2df-5d58-364d-acd4-555872013bc9",
                                "text": "These include syzygy, fusion of larvae or adults of flatworms, fusion of buds of some Tunicata, somatic fertilization (fusion of spermatozoa with somatic cells), composite zygotes of some Cestoda and Insecta, and fusion of cells in various tissues."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7f2e34b1-8f9d-3fcd-8d1d-c2b2c7ef0205",
                        "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The pairing of chromosomes in meiosis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d510a91c-b413-3c21-8d6f-0b52d9420d87",
                        "entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Complementary female–male pairings of the emanations known as Aeons."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d9123fb-6cad-44e4-a95a-1fec285f4eb9",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "source_sense_description": "astronomical conjunction",
                        "target_lang_word": "syzygie",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "syzygie",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45f5e9fe-49e8-3bee-b114-9b5d225c71ef",
                                        "entry_id": "2825c32f-0604-3673-9958-2e7a67256a11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "samenkoppeling van twee afzonderlijke zaken"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff0b5ee9-263b-4cbf-a117-2d9975eb727e",
                                                "sense_id": "45f5e9fe-49e8-3bee-b114-9b5d225c71ef",
                                                "text": "In de onderscheiding van idee en werkelijkheid, de eerste der reeks, is eigenlijk elke volgende syzygie ingewikkeld."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76934284-2c26-3c74-9b99-82f3e4c54b0b",
                                        "entry_id": "2825c32f-0604-3673-9958-2e7a67256a11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "situatie waarin drie hemellichamen in de ruimte op één rechte lijn staan, meestal gebruikt voor momenten waarop de maan of een planeet een plaats op de rechte lijn tussen zon en aarde inneemt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df18b8d5-5551-4a0e-8ea1-2227c7daedc6",
                                                "sense_id": "76934284-2c26-3c74-9b99-82f3e4c54b0b",
                                                "text": "Opnieuw syzygie. Maar deze keer staan de zon en maan in oppositie. Het is nu volle maan. Bij conjunctie is het nieuwe maan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd182f9b-921b-3b78-aaea-949302914f39",
                                        "entry_id": "2825c32f-0604-3673-9958-2e7a67256a11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in de abstract algebra de benaming voor een bepaald soort relatie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49f6a696-0e02-46ee-bfbd-a89c08fadf84",
                                                "sense_id": "cd182f9b-921b-3b78-aaea-949302914f39",
                                                "text": "Van de vele termen die Sylvester heeft ingevoerd zijn verscheidene blijvend bezit van de wiskundigen gebleven, wij denken b.v. aan de woorden invariant, covariant, contravariant, cogrediënt en syzygie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19cda03f-cc4d-3099-89b4-06474c6382da",
                                        "entry_id": "2825c32f-0604-3673-9958-2e7a67256a11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "paarsgewijze verbinding van de chromosomen bij de meiose tijdens celdeling"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab882201-c169-34b2-921f-48dafc09c7d1",
                                        "entry_id": "2825c32f-0604-3673-9958-2e7a67256a11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in de opvatting van Jung een fundamentele verband dat twee tegengestelde begrippen weer verenigt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73c231bc-19e3-473b-9e1c-4646de4f0ffc",
                                                "sense_id": "ab882201-c169-34b2-921f-48dafc09c7d1",
                                                "text": "De man-vrouwelijke syzygie is slechts één van de mogelijke tegenstellingsparen, overigens wel één van de belangrijkste en daarom meest voorkomende in de praktijk."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c854715-ef3a-3479-a864-4569c9cfe3f5",
                                        "entry_id": "2825c32f-0604-3673-9958-2e7a67256a11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "combinatie van twee versvoeten als een eenheid binnen een gedicht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b22d071a-4d0c-40c9-bf81-5d6d1691ca5c",
                                                "sense_id": "0c854715-ef3a-3479-a864-4569c9cfe3f5",
                                                "text": "Dipodie (…) of syzygie noemt men een verbinding van 2 voeten in een vers, (…)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "55b96a3d-eb38-4104-819a-38349068cac7",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "source_sense_description": "astronomical conjunction",
                        "target_lang_word": "syzygie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "syzygie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "498063c7-6692-34a5-9853-f4a1e2ff3b0d",
                                        "entry_id": "ee5d9415-9dcb-3675-9df4-23ea963fdf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Situation de trois corps célestes ou plus en conjonction ou en opposition. Se dit particulièrement pour la Lune avec la nouvelle lune et la pleine lune."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0738893-1950-4494-bd94-09c0840ea71e",
                                                "sense_id": "498063c7-6692-34a5-9853-f4a1e2ff3b0d",
                                                "text": "Les marées sont assez fortes dans les mers arctiques […]. Bien des navigateurs qui les ont observées […] ont vu la mer, à l’époque des syzygies, monter de vingt à vingt-cinq pieds au-dessus du niveau moyen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53841981-e295-4cb9-a02a-d529f97e655c",
                                                "sense_id": "498063c7-6692-34a5-9853-f4a1e2ff3b0d",
                                                "text": "En Angleterre, on commença à s’inquiéter lorsque les grandes marées de syzygie, en avril, ont franchi le mur de l’Embankment à Westminster."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "116762bd-8f2f-34c3-a9fd-59b38f3678be",
                                        "entry_id": "ee5d9415-9dcb-3675-9df4-23ea963fdf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relation entre les générateurs d’un module."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1541e53a-eaab-31d3-bcf0-c12b27d11857",
                                        "entry_id": "ee5d9415-9dcb-3675-9df4-23ea963fdf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Paire d’éons dans la pensée gnostique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2592288-00b2-49bf-ad4a-0f28d5fce402",
                                                "sense_id": "1541e53a-eaab-31d3-bcf0-c12b27d11857",
                                                "text": "Il existe quinze syzygies de trente éons. Par exemple: abîme-silence, intellect-vérité, logos-sagesse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3475e94a-e653-4490-9efa-74c05797ddd2",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd921c67-e841-33d8-a504-dd748f9f046b",
                        "source_sense_description": "astronomical conjunction",
